{
  "version": 1,
  "title": "Praxis with alpha-scaled sparse quotient powers",
  "claims": [
    "params.json is a parameter set of Praxis for the reference statement at 100-bit security whose ciphertext is 7637 MiB (7.4572 GiB) and whose time, one encryption plus one expected decryption, is 61591 million field multiplications (20238 and 41353), by the protected model, and every rule of the model as amended holds for it; proof.md proves that each amended entry (Ncmp, I3, I6, n2, dec_msm_g1, dec_msm_g2, dec_pairings, n1) is sound, so that the paper's theorems hold for these parameters as rules.md requires."
  ],
  "experiments": [],
